WEBVTT

00:00:11.497 --> 00:00:13.817
(BELL RINGING)

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:28.097
Hello? Anybody home?

00:00:28.857 --> 00:00:30.857
Felix? Mary?

00:00:31.177 --> 00:00:33.817
Well, you actually went and did it.

00:00:34.057 --> 00:00:36.657
Gene. Where is everybody?

00:00:37.017 --> 00:00:38.417
They're gone.

00:00:38.497 --> 00:00:42.017
After Felix went to find you
and then didn't come back...

00:00:42.177 --> 00:00:44.417
Everyone panicked
and abandoned ship.

00:00:44.537 --> 00:00:46.577
But I'm here now.

00:00:46.737 --> 00:00:48.577
It's too late, Ralph.

00:00:48.657 --> 00:00:50.977
Litwak's pulling our plug in the morning.

00:00:57.297 --> 00:00:58.377
Oh!

00:01:03.097 --> 00:01:06.337
But never let it be said
that I'm not a man of my word.

00:01:07.177 --> 00:01:09.377
The place is yours, Ralph. Enjoy.

00:01:12.977 --> 00:01:14.577
Gene, wait! Wait!

00:01:15.537 --> 00:01:18.457
Listen, this is not what I wanted!

00:01:18.697 --> 00:01:20.577
Well, what did you want, Ralph?

00:01:20.897 --> 00:01:23.057
I don't know. I just...

00:01:24.257 --> 00:01:25.497
(SIGHS)

00:01:26.097 --> 00:01:29.017
I was just tired of
living alone in the garbage.

00:01:30.377 --> 00:01:33.017
Well, now you can live alone
in the penthouse.

00:01:37.217 --> 00:01:38.337
(SIGHS)

00:02:05.137 --> 00:02:06.137
(THUDS)

00:02:26.177 --> 00:02:27.977
(BEEPING)

00:02:39.257 --> 00:02:40.297
(HUMMING)

00:02:40.377 --> 00:02:41.457
Hey, cough drop.

00:02:42.337 --> 00:02:43.777
Explain something to me.

00:02:43.977 --> 00:02:46.137
If Vanellope was never meant to exist,

00:02:46.297 --> 00:02:49.017
then why is her picture on
the side of the game console?

00:02:49.337 --> 00:02:50.857
Uh...

00:02:51.697 --> 00:02:52.857
(SHUDDERING)

00:02:53.697 --> 00:02:54.737
What's going on

00:02:54.817 --> 00:02:56.217
in this candy-coated heart of darkness?

00:02:56.337 --> 00:02:57.337
Nothing.

00:02:57.457 --> 00:02:58.497
-Talk!
-No.

00:02:58.617 --> 00:03:00.097
-I'll lick you.
-You wouldn't.

00:03:00.217 --> 00:03:02.017
Oh, yeah?

00:03:02.257 --> 00:03:03.577
Oh! That's like sandpaper!

00:03:03.817 --> 00:03:06.337
Mmm. Wonder how many
licks it will take

00:03:06.417 --> 00:03:07.737
to get to your center.

00:03:07.977 --> 00:03:09.337
I'll take it to my grave!

00:03:09.577 --> 00:03:10.617
Fair enough.

00:03:11.937 --> 00:03:12.937
Oh!

00:03:14.577 --> 00:03:16.297
(EXCLAIMS) They call you
Sour Bill for a reason.

00:03:17.417 --> 00:03:20.657
-Had enough yet?
-Okay, I'll talk, I'll talk!

00:03:20.897 --> 00:03:22.377
Vanellope was a racer

00:03:22.457 --> 00:03:24.937
until King Candy
tried to delete her code!

00:03:25.097 --> 00:03:27.097
RALPH: Tried to delete her code?

00:03:27.177 --> 00:03:30.137
So that's why she's a glitch!
Why is he doing this to her?

00:03:30.457 --> 00:03:31.537
I don't know!

00:03:31.777 --> 00:03:32.777
Suit yourself.

00:03:32.977 --> 00:03:34.817
No, no, no! I swear I don't know!

00:03:35.177 --> 00:03:37.737
He literally locked up our memories

00:03:37.817 --> 00:03:39.017
and I cannot remember!

00:03:39.177 --> 00:03:40.417
Nobody can!

00:03:40.817 --> 00:03:42.217
But I do know this.

00:03:42.497 --> 00:03:44.177
He'll do anything
to keep her from racing.

00:03:44.337 --> 00:03:46.777
Because if she crosses the finish line,

00:03:46.857 --> 00:03:49.697
the game will reset and
she won't be a glitch anymore!

00:03:50.017 --> 00:03:51.017
Where is she now?

00:03:51.137 --> 00:03:52.457
In the fungeon with Fix-It Felix.

00:03:52.697 --> 00:03:53.697
Felix?

00:03:53.777 --> 00:03:55.577
I'm sorry! That's all I know, I swear!

00:03:55.737 --> 00:03:59.857
Now, please, don't put me back
in your filthy mouth again! (SOBBING)

00:04:02.337 --> 00:04:03.337
Stick around.

00:04:03.417 --> 00:04:06.577
Yes, okay, I will. I will. Thank you!

00:04:10.257 --> 00:04:12.337
Come on. I know you're out there.

00:04:12.457 --> 00:04:13.457
(GRUNTS ANGRILY)

00:04:13.777 --> 00:04:16.177
Saccharine-saturated nightmare!

00:04:16.497 --> 00:04:18.017
(BEEPING RAPIDLY)

00:04:18.977 --> 00:04:21.617
(GASPS) But... Where?

00:04:21.937 --> 00:04:22.977
(SCREAMING)

00:04:29.017 --> 00:04:30.337
(SCREECHING)

00:04:38.297 --> 00:04:42.817
Doomsday and Armageddon
just had a baby and it is ugly!

00:04:45.097 --> 00:04:46.897
Hello? Hello?

00:04:47.897 --> 00:04:51.297
Somebody! Anybody! Please let me out!

00:04:53.377 --> 00:04:54.457
What's he say?

00:04:55.137 --> 00:04:56.937
(IMITATING RALPH)
I'm gonna wreck it!

00:04:59.697 --> 00:05:00.697
(GROANS)

00:05:00.817 --> 00:05:03.737
Why do I fix everything I touch?

00:05:04.017 --> 00:05:05.537
Oh! (SOBS)

00:05:06.017 --> 00:05:07.017
Bam!

00:05:07.857 --> 00:05:09.657
-Felix!
-Ralph!

00:05:09.817 --> 00:05:11.937
I'm so glad to see you!

00:05:12.017 --> 00:05:15.657
Wait. No, I'm not. What do
you have to say for yourself!

00:05:15.817 --> 00:05:18.777
Wait! I don't want to hear it.
I'm not talking to you!

00:05:18.857 --> 00:05:20.617
Okay, don't talk. That's fine.

00:05:20.737 --> 00:05:22.697
But you have to fix
this go-cart for me pronto.

00:05:23.017 --> 00:05:25.937
I don't have to do boo!
Forgive my potty mouth.

00:05:26.177 --> 00:05:29.017
I'm just so, so cross with you!

00:05:29.337 --> 00:05:31.257
Do you have any idea
what you put me through?

00:05:31.377 --> 00:05:34.777
I ran higgledy-piggledy
all over creation looking for you.

00:05:35.017 --> 00:05:36.897
I almost drowned in chocolate milk-mix!

00:05:37.297 --> 00:05:40.817
And then... I met the most dynamite gal.

00:05:41.137 --> 00:05:44.577
Oh! She gives me the honey glow
something awful.

00:05:45.257 --> 00:05:47.937
But she rebuffed my affections.

00:05:48.017 --> 00:05:50.177
And then I got thrown in jail!

00:05:50.377 --> 00:05:51.777
Felix, pull yourself together.

00:05:52.337 --> 00:05:55.697
No! You don't know
what it's like to be rejected

00:05:55.817 --> 00:05:57.457
and treated like a criminal!

00:05:57.617 --> 00:06:00.257
Yes, I do. That's every day of my life.

00:06:01.297 --> 00:06:02.297
It is?

00:06:02.497 --> 00:06:06.297
Which is why I ran off
and tried to be a good guy, but I'm not!

00:06:06.457 --> 00:06:09.217
I'm just a bad guy, and I need your help.

00:06:09.457 --> 00:06:11.577
There's a little girl
whose only hope is this cart.

00:06:11.777 --> 00:06:13.697
Please, Felix, fix it.

00:06:14.097 --> 00:06:17.257
And I promise I will never try
to be good again.

